# zlib 1.2.13's release tarball, and the files of it vendored in
# vendor/zlib-1.2.13/, byte for byte. The tarball is
# https://zlib.net/fossils/zlib-1.2.13.tar.gz, the same file as the release
# asset https://github.com/madler/zlib/releases/download/v1.2.13/zlib-1.2.13.tar.gz;
# its sha256 is the first line below. Each other line is a member of it
# (the folder named as in the tarball): the deflate side the build compiles
# (build.rs), the headers it includes, and the licence and README. Nothing
# else of the tarball is vendored, and no vendored file is changed.
#
# tests/zlib.rs checks that vendor/zlib-1.2.13/ holds exactly these files
# with these hashes. scripts/zlib_vendor.py verify TARBALL checks a
# downloaded tarball against the first line and every vendored file against
# its member.
